{"id": "CLM-001", "image_id": "CASE-001", "region_id": "REG-001-RML", "text": "右肺中野透亮度均匀，未见明确局灶性密度增高、结节或空洞影。", "sign_ids": ["SIGN-002", "SIGN-003"], "guideline_ids": ["GL-LUNGRADS-01"], "disclaimer": "仅作表现对照，不构成诊断意见。", "cites": [{"cite_id": "CIT-0001-S", "kind": "spatial", "anchor": {"image_id": "CASE-001", "region_id": "REG-001-RML", "bbox": [0.135, 0.365, 0.32, 0.2], "atlas_id": "ATLAS-CHEST-PA-6", "annotator": "human", "annotated_at": "2026-11-15"}}, {"cite_id": "CIT-0001-D0", "kind": "doc", "anchor": {"doc_kind": "guideline", "doc_id": "GL-LUNGRADS-01", "doc_title": "ACR Lung-RADS", "version": "2022", "locator": "类别 1 · 筛查随访", "excerpt": "未见肺结节或仅见良性表现者，按年度低剂量 CT 继续筛查。", "excerpt_sha256": "2b53e5d9", "url": "https://www.acr.org/Clinical-Resources/Reporting-and-Data-Systems/Lung-Rads", "retrieved_at": "2026-11-15"}}], "note": "正常对照：该分区无阳性表现，文献侧给出类别 1 的随访口径。"}
{"id": "CLM-002", "image_id": "CASE-006", "region_id": "REG-006-RML", "text": "右肺中野见片状密度增高影，边界不清，其内可见支气管充气征。", "sign_ids": ["SIGN-002", "SIGN-014"], "guideline_ids": [], "disclaimer": "仅作表现对照，不构成诊断意见。", "cites": [{"cite_id": "CIT-0002-S", "kind": "spatial", "anchor": {"image_id": "CASE-006", "region_id": "REG-006-RML", "bbox": [0.13, 0.44, 0.31, 0.3], "atlas_id": "ATLAS-CHEST-PA-6", "annotator": "human", "annotated_at": "2026-11-15"}}, {"cite_id": "CIT-0002-D0", "kind": "doc", "anchor": {"doc_kind": "sign", "doc_id": "SIGN-002", "doc_title": "征象词条 · 实变", "version": "v2026-11-15", "locator": "SIGN-002 / 影像表现", "excerpt": "肺泡内气体被渗出物、细胞或组织替代，表现为密度增高的片状影，可伴空气支气管征。", "excerpt_sha256": "fc1036bc", "url": "https://radiopaedia.org/articles/consolidation", "retrieved_at": "2026-11-15"}}], "note": "文献锚点为征象词条定义（非指南条款）：库内无「实变」为适用条件的条款，故不套用 Lung-RADS。"}
{"id": "CLM-003", "image_id": "CASE-006", "region_id": "REG-006-RML", "text": "该分区表现归入「肺部实变与气腔影」对照组，可与同组公开影像并排对照。", "sign_ids": ["SIGN-002", "SIGN-014", "SIGN-019"], "guideline_ids": [], "disclaimer": "仅作表现对照，不构成诊断意见。", "cites": [{"cite_id": "CIT-0003-S", "kind": "spatial", "anchor": {"image_id": "CASE-006", "region_id": "REG-006-RML", "bbox": [0.13, 0.44, 0.31, 0.3], "atlas_id": "ATLAS-CHEST-PA-6", "annotator": "human", "annotated_at": "2026-11-15"}}, {"cite_id": "CIT-0003-D0", "kind": "doc", "anchor": {"doc_kind": "group", "doc_id": "GRP-LUNG-CONSOLIDATION", "doc_title": "影像组 · 肺部实变与气腔影", "version": "2026-11-15", "locator": "GRP-LUNG-CONSOLIDATION / criteria", "excerpt": "归类依据：来源公开描述含 pneumonia / consolidation / air-space opacity / atelectasis 等关键词，或图中自带标注。", "excerpt_sha256": "1187ccc7", "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Category:Pneumonia_on_X-rays", "retrieved_at": "2026-11-15"}}], "note": "组内病因不同，仅按影像表现归类，不代表同一疾病。"}
{"id": "CLM-004", "image_id": "CASE-006", "region_id": "REG-006-RML", "text": "若需按 Lung-RADS 归类，还需结节最大径、实性成分比例与既往片比较。", "sign_ids": [], "guideline_ids": ["GL-LUNGRADS-06"], "disclaimer": "仅作条件提示，不构成诊断意见。", "cites": [{"cite_id": "CIT-0004-D0", "kind": "doc", "anchor": {"doc_kind": "guideline", "doc_id": "GL-LUNGRADS-06", "doc_title": "ACR Lung-RADS", "version": "2022", "locator": "通用 · 比较原则", "excerpt": "判读时应与既往检查比较，结节大小变化与类别调整需记录依据。", "excerpt_sha256": "3c76ed89", "url": "https://www.acr.org/Clinical-Resources/Reporting-and-Data-Systems/Lung-Rads", "retrieved_at": "2026-11-15"}}], "note": "单引用降级：文献侧有依据，但无法指到图上某一块，因此不显示为双引用。", "gate_reason": "缺少空间锚点：该条为条件提示，未绑定具体分区。"}
{"id": "CLM-005", "image_id": "CASE-011", "region_id": "REG-011-CENTER", "text": "图像中央可见边界较清的低回声结节，内部回声不均，后方伴声影。", "sign_ids": ["SIGN-058", "SIGN-060"], "guideline_ids": [], "disclaimer": "仅作表现对照，不构成诊断意见。", "cites": [{"cite_id": "CIT-0005-S", "kind": "spatial", "anchor": {"image_id": "CASE-011", "region_id": "REG-011-CENTER", "bbox": [0.31, 0.29, 0.42, 0.36], "atlas_id": "ATLAS-THY-US-LOCAL", "annotator": "human", "annotated_at": "2026-11-15"}}, {"cite_id": "CIT-0005-D0", "kind": "doc", "anchor": {"doc_kind": "sign", "doc_id": "SIGN-058", "doc_title": "征象词条 · 低回声结节", "version": "v2026-11-15", "locator": "SIGN-058 / 影像表现", "excerpt": "结节回声低于周围正常甲状腺实质，可为实性低回声灶；需结合形态、边缘与强回声灶综合描述。", "excerpt_sha256": "65d5b1ce", "url": "https://radiopaedia.org/articles/thyroid-nodule", "retrieved_at": "2026-11-15"}}], "note": "该模态为 local 级定位：只说明「图像中央」，不推断左叶或右叶。"}
{"id": "CLM-006", "image_id": "CASE-011", "region_id": "REG-011-CENTER", "text": "按 TI-RADS 描述要素，报告需记录成分、回声、形态、边缘与强回声灶五个维度后再分类。", "sign_ids": ["SIGN-058", "SIGN-057"], "guideline_ids": ["GL-TIRADS-06"], "disclaimer": "仅作要素提示，不构成诊断意见。", "cites": [{"cite_id": "CIT-0006-S", "kind": "spatial", "anchor": {"image_id": "CASE-011", "region_id": "REG-011-CENTER", "bbox": [0.31, 0.29, 0.42, 0.36], "atlas_id": "ATLAS-THY-US-LOCAL", "annotator": "human", "annotated_at": "2026-11-15"}}, {"cite_id": "CIT-0006-D0", "kind": "doc", "anchor": {"doc_kind": "guideline", "doc_id": "GL-TIRADS-06", "doc_title": "ACR TI-RADS", "version": "2017", "locator": "通用 · 描述要素", "excerpt": "报告应记录成分、回声、形态、边缘与强回声灶五个维度，再给出分类。", "excerpt_sha256": "334d02ab", "url": "https://www.acr.org/Clinical-Resources/Reporting-and-Data-Systems/TI-RADS", "retrieved_at": "2026-11-15"}}], "note": "条款只给「要记录哪些维度」，不给分类结论；分类需完整五维输入。"}
{"id": "CLM-007", "image_id": "CASE-011", "region_id": "REG-011-CENTER", "text": "TI-RADS 4 类结节最大径达 1.0 cm 时可考虑穿刺。", "sign_ids": ["SIGN-058"], "guideline_ids": ["GL-TIRADS-03"], "disclaimer": "该条引用未通过校验，不进入回答。", "cites": [{"cite_id": "CIT-0007-S", "kind": "spatial", "anchor": {"image_id": "CASE-011", "region_id": "REG-011-CENTER", "bbox": [0.31, 0.29, 0.42, 0.36], "atlas_id": "ATLAS-THY-US-LOCAL", "annotator": "human", "annotated_at": "2026-11-15"}}, {"cite_id": "CIT-0007-D0", "kind": "doc", "anchor": {"doc_kind": "guideline", "doc_id": "GL-TIRADS-03", "doc_title": "ACR TI-RADS", "version": "2017", "locator": "TR4 · 穿刺与随访", "excerpt": "TR4 类结节最大径达到约 1.0 cm 时可考虑穿刺；1.0—1.5 cm 以随访为主。", "excerpt_sha256": "2bcb2996", "url": "https://www.acr.org/Clinical-Resources/Reporting-and-Data-Systems/TI-RADS", "retrieved_at": "2026-11-15"}}], "note": "失败案例：模型把阈值从 1.5 cm 改写成 1.0 cm，校验不通过，整条不进入回答。"}
